1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,774
Midnight. Strange scraping sounds above our ceiling.

2
00:00:02,975 --> 00:00:05,270
The forbidden attic trunk is glowing green.

3
00:00:05,370 --> 00:00:07,060
Hold the flashlight steady, Mox!

4
00:00:07,209 --> 00:00:09,450
Something with huge glowing eyes is inside!

5
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:11,130
Turn the rusty brass key now.

6
00:00:11,330 --> 00:00:13,349
Surprise! I made an arcade in here!

7
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:15,464
Did you hear footsteps on the roof?

